sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as VersionHistoryPanel
    participant FSS as FileSystemService
    participant MinIO as MinIO

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,MinIO: View Version History
    end

    User->>UI: Click "Version History" button
    activate UI

    UI->>FSS: GET /api/projects/{projectId}/files/versions?path={filePath}
    activate FSS

    FSS->>MinIO: listObjects(bucket, objectName, false, {IncludeVersion: true})
    activate MinIO
    MinIO-->>FSS: Stream of version objects
    deactivate MinIO

    FSS->>FSS: Transform to FileVersion[] format\n(sort by lastModified descending)
    FSS-->>UI: {success: true, file: filePath, versions: [...], totalVersions: N}
    deactivate FSS

    UI->>UI: Display version timeline with timestamps and metadata
    UI-->>User: Show versions with timestamps
    deactivate UI
